    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_ThisIsGalacticVeilstoneBuilding",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome.\n",
        "This is Team Galactic Headqu...\r",
        "I’m sorry, this is the Galactic\n",
        "Veilstone Building.\r",
        "Cosmic energy for the win!\r",
        "Wouldn’t it be wonderful if we\n",
        "could harness that boundless energy?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue.\n",
        "C’est le QG de la Team Ga...\r",
        "Pardon, c’est le Bâtiment Galaxie\n",
        "de Voilaroc.\r",
        "L’énergie cosmique, \n",
        "c’est trop mythique!\r",
        "Ça ne serait pas formidable si on \n",
        "maîtrisait cette énergie inépuisable?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_WeHaveNoPlansNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome.\n",
        "This is Team Galactic Headqu...\r",
        "I’m sorry, this is the Galactic\n",
        "Veilstone Building.\r",
        "I’m not certain if it’s a good thing or\n",
        "not, but we have no plans now."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue.\n",
        "C’est le QG de la Team Ga...\r",
        "Pardon, c’est le Bâtiment Galaxie\n",
        "de Voilaroc.\r",
        "Je ne sais pas si c’est une bonne\n",
        "chose, mais nous n’avons rien de\f",
        "prévu pour l’instant."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_GalacticConductsRnD",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic conducts R&D around\n",
        "the clock here.\r",
        "We focus on the development of new\n",
        "energy resources."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La Team Galaxie mène des recherches\n",
        "jour et nuit dans ce bâtiment.\r",
        "Nous travaillons au développement\n",
        "de nouvelles sources d’énergie."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_ThisIsWhereWeWork",
      "en_US": [
        "This is where we, Team Galactic, work.\n",
        "What are we supposed to do?\r",
        "I’m not sure how, but we’re supposed\n",
        "to chase our dream.\r",
        "Our dream of making a wonderful\n",
        "new world!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est l’endroit où travaille la Team\n",
        "Galaxie... Que devons-nous faire?\r",
        "Nous devons poursuivre notre\n",
        "rêve, par tous les moyens!\r",
        "Notre rêve de bâtir un nouveau\n",
        "monde merveilleux!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_WeWillTakeEverything",
      "en_US": [
        "We, Team Galactic, will take everything\n",
        "that can be taken!\r",
        "We will eliminate everything that is\n",
        "not needed!\r",
        "That is Team Galactic’s policy!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Nous, la Team Galaxie, nous prendrons\n",
        "tout sans rien donner!\r",
        "Nous éliminerons tout ce qui\n",
        "ne nous est pas utile!\r",
        "C’est notre politique galactique!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_NothingLeftNow",
      "en_US": [
        "We, Team Galactic, will take everything\n",
        "that can be taken!\r",
        "We will eliminate everything that is\n",
        "not needed!\r",
        "That is Team Galactic’s policy!\r",
        "At least it used to be.\n",
        "There’s nothing left now..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Nous, la Team Galaxie, nous prendrons\n",
        "tout sans rien donner!\r",
        "Nous éliminerons tout ce qui\n",
        "ne nous est pas utile!\r",
        "C’est notre politique galactique!\r",
        "Ou plutôt, c’était... Quand on voit ce\n",
        "qu’il reste de la Team Galaxie..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_YoureTooYoung",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re too young for us...\n",
        "You can join us when you’re older."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "T’es trop jeune pour nous... Reviens\n",
        "quand tu auras pris de la bouteille."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_IWonderWhereBossWent",
      "en_US": "I wonder where our boss went...",
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je me demande où est passé \n",
        "notre chef..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GalacticHQ1F_Text_WhatToDo",
      "en_US": [
        "Saturn: So, it’s you...\r",
        "I’ve heard about you and what took\n",
        "place at the Spear Pillar.\r",
        "Our leader, Master Cyrus, hated the\n",
        "very idea of spirit.\r",
        "He hated spirit for being incomplete.\r",
        "And yet, using fiery exhortations,\n",
        "he rallied the spirit of others.\r",
        "What he hated most, he used to control\n",
        "others. Isn’t that ironic?\r",
        "That fascinated me.\n",
        "I wanted to see what he would do.\r",
        "And I did. At his side.\n",
        "But it’s over.\r",
        "A world without spirit...\n",
        "Who would want such a thing?!\r",
        "So, what now...?\n",
        "What to do with Team Galactic?\r",
        "But I’ve learned that extremism\n",
        "is never the solution...\r",
        "Perhaps we should really be searching\n",
        "for new sources of energy.\r",
        "Instead of lying about it through our\n",
        "commercials."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Saturne: Alors te voilà...\r",
        "J’ai entendu parler de toi et de ce qui\n",
        "s’est passé aux Colonnes Lances.\r",
        "Maître Hélio, notre révéré guide, avait\n",
        "en horreur la seule idée d’esprit.\r",
        "Il haïssait son côté incomplet, partiel.\r",
        "Et pourtant, sa rhétorique imparable\n",
        "lui a permis de rallier d’autres esprits.\r",
        "Ainsi, il utilisait ce qu’il détestait le\n",
        "plus pour contrôler les autres.\r",
        "C’est ça qui me fascinait chez lui.\n",
        "J’étais prêt à le suivre où qu’il aille.\r",
        "Et c’est ce que j’ai fait.\n",
        "Mais tout est fini à présent.\r",
        "Un monde dénué d’esprit...\n",
        "Qui voudrait d’une chose pareille?!\r",
        "Et maintenant...?\n",
        "Que faire avec la Team Galaxie?\r",
        "J’ai réalisé que l’extrémisme n’était\n",
        "jamais une solution...\r",
        "Et si nous nous lancions vraiment dans\n",
        "la recherche d’une énergie nouvelle?\r",
        "Plutôt que de nous contenter de le\n",
        "prétendre dans les publicités..."
      ]
    },
    {
